    {
      "id": "2401eed0-df41-4d53-9fbd-f16cdf77f069",
      "title": "Leia a orientação curta e observe o sentido de proximidade desta aula.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "892db70e-4d9c-4001-9a5d-be258d5b820e",
          "textContent": "<p>Quando algo está perto de você, o espanhol costuma marcar essa proximidade.</p><p>Nesta aula, você vai ver quatro formas curtas para apontar pessoas e objetos próximos sem falar de coisas distantes.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a33d40af-fb4b-4d16-9680-c9ad710dc516",
      "title": "Olhe a imagem, escute o áudio e observe a frase em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "f3f9e92f-f422-4f55-b5ca-3530afb934db",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe o objeto perto da pessoa.</p><p><strong>este móvil</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>este celular</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/83538b38beb94090a2b06647c7cdd3b2_b02-este-movil.png?Expires=1794099470&Signature=RJpxEdsS5-oORdnF1SmoffiAuygaCeAeHF41I~u5VpdE1cT1RFqhddYePK8IxTbSM0pftxOxp1~dHViPx95Pl4qG10FvmLc-kdd-CUAEPmF9z9jkxjaWoHwVYj5Gg3hXA2lOaH5gllBZxfs5Csmml804Cp4jSVasjJUuBxDbQqyZdWAIGxoqY2YtA7e77HeSMHW0--VdbgHkLci8D-IqS1rIAsCUOa5sLjAakTGTIuwSFBRZF~KbYwjNbxzslgESGstyE2iJQzO5vDEeaWpfs6dUHtWCxoEHNeHifMiZX-JQ9napTfyiLB6s8CNs2s-RAz29nh~bhHwn92kh6c3fbg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8778dbd8d8ba4d5eade5c40de7145c64_b02-este-movil.mp3?Expires=1794099470&Signature=hzi1hI-PrsewnXkkt18NwF8gNXCiKStRAX2V3jS7XgvH3PKWlXJx376ye~voRKvfvIlxgdFTdyOMYJIiGP0NsWNLt1ergeXTTyjvu5Qn7zbDD7k82BpipJYUw~D4Li3E42~oLqVNnbyP7I-mtmf21Aw1U0P66yekVfWX~SxPs3jTW6Wkil3Q3t4Qdq8MwjKTgzR4ZISZ4nR7Z-vn9InQ-G9qP7KcDeLxakFW~mgQVLtGHYP5vYoLDO21XKe4jaP5JqOZJMZqX1fXzJJDPa~MO45EO9RBdeyjVIzt4mKEIiLnDaiwnjhqLjsZzu2TeYrs0Yj9yceotcOY468LASjxyQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
